STARTING TEMPLATE, NOT LEGAL ADVICE. Have a real estate attorney licensed in {state} review this form once before you use it for the first time, and again if the law changes.

LOAN TERM SHEET (NOT A COMMITMENT TO LEND)

Date: {today}

Borrower: {buyer_name}
Lender: {lender_name}
Property: {property_address}, {county} County, {state}

Purchase price: {price}
Repair budget: {repair_budget}
After-repair value (ARV): {arv}
Loan amount: {loan_amount}
Loan to cost / loan to value: {ltv}

Interest: {interest_rate}% a year, interest-only, paid monthly
Points: {points} points at closing
Term: {term_months} months, extension of {extension} on request for {extension_fee}
Repair money: paid in draws after inspection of finished work
Security: first lien (mortgage or deed of trust) on the property and a personal guarantee
Prepayment: none
Closing: through {title_company} on or before {closing_date}
Exit plan: {exit_plan}

This term sheet is only for discussion. The loan is made only when both sides sign the lender's loan documents.

Borrower: ______________________________
Lender: ______________________________
